{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "045de5e2d4a93b0eea4a3429c99eddd0a14844ed4752800280a7c6fb1227b56d", "ja": "輝きに導かれるように", "zh": "宛如被光芒指引一般", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "37efc069426bbce513e7d9a2ff80c43f564692f95b23ec38ac082c730c89e840", "ja": "『ルナ』の打ち上げが行われる中、劇場の\nアイドル達からメッセージが届く。新たな\n月に照らされたことで、劇場からもまた新\nたな輝きが生み出されるだろうとプロデュ\nーサーは確信するのだった。", "zh": "在举行《Luna》的庆功宴时，剧场的\n偶像们纷纷送来了留言。制作人确信，\n被崭新的月亮照耀后，剧场也将再次\n绽放出全新的光辉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ef41f65e452922ab8a8e3c76d6fcffa9979347e06bfece3816fb3c71baa332c5", "ja": "（『ルナ』の開演から数日。あの日のライブは、\n各種メディアで取り上げられ、大きな話題を呼んだ）", "zh": "（『Luna』开演几天后。那天的演出被各大媒体争相报道，引发了热烈话题）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f7bbd6eb60ad07edbedba6dc235aa33f5cc198cabb2d15d53d75170e59b11d77", "ja": "（ツアーの取材依頼も相次ぐ中、今日は\nスケジュールの合間を縫って、みんなで打ち上げだ！）", "zh": "（巡演的采访邀约接连不断，今天就趁着行程的空档，和大家一起举办庆功宴！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "55a8f47c2c7d83954365468101c72f329d6389cdc701cc130d34d5818f08dbd3", "ja": "みんな、忙しい中、本当によく頑張ってくれた。\n初回公演の成功を祝って……乾杯！", "zh": "大家都在百忙之中努力了这么久，真的辛苦了。\n为了庆祝首场公演成功……干杯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "9cc50c6f90eeadfee0bbdbe9940d097d8b7aac00878889605bd05e614cc13473", "ja": "かんぱーい！", "zh": "干杯～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "ded82920a2e5dc48112f9790df6bd05b3075f5165a4bc883c748a7866d00f199", "ja": "乾杯…。", "zh": "干杯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "89c1bea1d91d6d80365cb753b7052ff53208188f9931b0f77f6263581dd7d1c1", "ja": "かんぱ～い♪", "zh": "干杯～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "9cc50c6f90eeadfee0bbdbe9940d097d8b7aac00878889605bd05e614cc13473", "ja": "かんぱーい！", "zh": "干杯～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1007_se", "source_sha256": "0a15d1bebb49d07f7ed485eda634023c204bbc2d3606116e3205f39ed1fc9740", "ja": "ピロリン！　×4", "zh": "叮咚！　×4", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "5a73f25f7409edda976280575a307020cf7eb8a3a82a927502b4f8610d296705", "ja": "あれ、みんな同時にメッセージ？\nなんだろ……。", "zh": "哎呀，大家同时发来消息了？\n是什么事呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "d4983780159ebd2896919beff23a6875fc7b5e9b9acc6b81bdf1b304640ac1b9", "ja": "あ、『BlueMoon Harmony』の\nみんなからだぞ！　えっと……。", "zh": "啊，是《BlueMoon Harmony》的大家发来的！\n呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "6fafc62b3da619f7ec53729a055ed543dbe73e590c4696f910f8faef0215d04f", "ja": "「まさに圧巻の公演でした。月のバトンを繋げて\nもらえて、私は感無量です。……感謝感激」", "zh": "“真是一场令人叹为观止的演出。能接过月亮的接力棒，我感慨万千。……感激不尽。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "77154d699fcb426f5194e98bd306d5b8c5d366e194779846763e0af096de2849", "ja": "「ちょうどオフの日だったから、予定が合ったみんなと\n観に行ったよ！　最高に熱いステージだったね！」", "zh": "「正好那天休息，所以就和时间安排得上的大家一起去看了！真是超燃的舞台呢！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "4594f98c91d8cb70925e36692b636ec0f9ae90133f51a1c9904d3217e253d6a7", "ja": "「アタシ達の月とはまた違う、超カッコイイ『ルナ』\nだったよね！　劇場で待ってるね、にゃはは♪」", "zh": "「和我们那个月亮又不一样，是超级帅气的『Luna』呢！  \n我在剧场等你哦，喵哈哈♪」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "edb7d027f5dcb93a0e52a3e0ac1ad280abfd919650bd62335a23726af373ffb3", "ja": "「わたくしたちも、あずさたちに負けないよう\n『STARDOM ROAD』を駆け抜けますわ！」", "zh": "“我们也不会输给梓她们，\n要在『STARDOM ROAD』上一路飞驰向前呢！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "900636baeed198774971b7a2d91ef38726f3ffe027289536be1d10c09763ce08", "ja": "劇場のみんなにも、\n『ルナ』の熱いチャレンジが響いたみたいだな。", "zh": "看来剧场的大家也感受到了『月神』热烈的挑战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "0e4152d594ded89aea754fb5d3bdf0c9fc1455637e0994fa3bd000deafd651c9", "ja": "うん！　すっごくうれしいぞ～！　自分たちも、\n劇場のみんなに最高のバトンを渡せたってことだよね？", "zh": "嗯！我特别开心～！我们也算是把最棒的接力棒交给剧场的大家了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "48e8ea00a56db07208e8f133373955f2608cbc4791525157d4d10d5210ad851e", "ja": "ああ。響達が『BlueMoon Harmony』から\nバトンを受け取ったように……。", "zh": "就像响她们从《BlueMoon Harmony》接过接力棒一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e97144e1b6447860b25c269137fa9fee62c1624197efcc5f92cdae341fefa5cf", "ja": "『ルナ』のバトンは、次の天体公演のメンバー\nだけじゃなく、劇場のみんなにも渡されてる。", "zh": "“月神”的接力棒，不只是传给下一场天体公演的成员，也传给了剧场里的每一个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "df6e6e7538e7e8bfc0117ea058c80ffbf635c2610d2670ab82101aac23672994", "ja": "過去から未来に、劇場の外から中に、\n光が繋がっていくんですね。", "zh": "从过去到未来，从剧场外到剧场内，光芒就这样连接起来了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "50abd6b875fc7cf2d6a373b2aa4ed5e866e454906339ae5166c9f741d9b59c52", "ja": "でも、私たちのツアー公演も、まだまだこれから。\n明日からまた頑張りましょうね。", "zh": "不过，我们的巡演公演也还在继续。\n明天开始也一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "42487b1338d6176b2cf47c98dc8ab6995cf39b017f0f1631d5afcb3d353d5e97", "ja": "あ、でも『STARDOM ROAD』も観てみたいなぁ……\nそうだ、今度のオフにみんなで観に行こうよ！", "zh": "啊，不过《STARDOM ROAD》我也想看看啊……\n对了，下次休息日大家一起去看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "e04d564144e3fa4c56a08317ef943d8717c063859838d89eddaf78f1def38917", "ja": "賛成だぞ！　自分も続きが気になってたからね！\n{$P$}は教えてくれないし！", "zh": "赞成！我也一直很想知道后续呢！\n可{$P$}就是不肯告诉我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1022_010azu", "source_sha256": "cc1038d9836a36308bdf1d69f5b4777b8afa79012978ddb27c9c2a93c6b59785", "ja": "今度は誰が出るのか……。\nあとでこのみちゃんに聞いてみようかしら～？", "zh": "下次会是谁出场呢……\n待会儿要不要去问问木实呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1023_002chi", "source_sha256": "d6eba6aa4d6cb79f46e3921bdb8f43abfd855da481af4ae0a1f27fa213f74688", "ja": "まだまだ物語は続くそうですから。\nあまり急いで知ろうとしなくても大丈夫だと思います。", "zh": "听说故事还会继续写下去呢。\n我想不用那么着急去打听也没关系的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "ed5a4bc7acf61fe7654d5ab756a3b58fab8af296bd96a3aaa086c24fbf66e9e5", "ja": "ボクたちも、全力で応援しようね！\n劇場の夜を照らす『ルナ』として！　えへへ♪", "zh": "我们也一起全力支持吧！\n作为照亮剧场之夜的“露娜”！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "775e915252a5d0985998316a9c8080b1f9a084927ab24548f6974fdd272c45e0", "ja": "（彼女たちが見せてくれた月明かりは、この先も\n消えることなく、夜空を照らし続けるだろう……）", "zh": "（她们为我们展现的月光，今后也一定会永不消散，持续照亮夜空吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "c8a5633bc690fdc2ce62e09dfbf85afd57869106b17fd522785079094e1276a7", "ja": "（その光に導かれるように、星たちが集まり、\n瞬き始める。広げていこう、この輝きをどこまでも！）", "zh": "（群星仿佛受到那道光的指引，聚集而来，\n开始闪烁。让这份光辉无限延展下去吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
